Package: ADCPeptideMapper
Title: ADC Peptide Mapper — In-silico Digest & Transition List Generator
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2026-10-04
Authors@R: person("Nishikant", "Wase", email = "nishikant.wase@gmail.com",
                   role = c("aut", "cre"),
                   comment = c(ORCID = ""))
Description: R Shiny application for Antibody-Drug Conjugate (ADC) peptide
    mapping. Provides in-silico proteolytic digestion with 11 enzymes,
    uniqueness filtering against Human / Cynomolgus Monkey / Rat background
    proteomes, drug-to-antibody ratio (DAR) modeling, linker biotransformation
    variable modifications, multi-instrument MRM/DIA transition list generation
    (Skyline, Thermo, SCIEX, Bruker, Agilent, Waters), MRM quality assessment,
    ADC design and target biology scoring tools, and an AI-powered assistant
    tab (Anthropic Claude API).
